// The process and its environment (M6 Task 10).
//
// `exit(code)` and `getenv(name)` are builtins, in scope in every file. This
// module adds the statement-shaped exit a report wants and documents the
// environment spelling beside it.
//
// `getcwd()` is not provided yet: the runtime has no call that answers the
// working directory, and a wrapper that returned the empty string would be a
// wrong answer a program could act on. The name is reserved for the release
// that adds the runtime entry point.
//
// Ownership: `exit_with` never returns and owns nothing.

pub fn exit_with(code: int) {
    exit(code);
}
